input:
app.get('/u/:id', async (req, res) => {
  const u = await db.find(req.params.id);
  res.json(u);
});

output:
Fungsi async yang throw melangkau handler ralat Express 4 (unhandled rejection → crash). Balut setiap laluan async:
```js
const ah = (fn) => (req, res, next) => fn(req, res, next).catch(next);
app.get('/u/:id', ah(async (req, res) => {
  const u = await db.find(req.params.id);
  res.json(u);
}));
```
Atau naik Express 5 (sokong async natif). Setiap laluan async dibalut — tiada pengecualian.

