res.json(rows);
```
Every user input parameterized — no exceptions, no excuses.

input:
const data = await fetch('/api');
const users = await data.json();
console.log(users.length);

output:
Tiada `try/catch` dan tiada timeout — rangkaian gagal = gantung selamanya atau unhandled rejection. Corak selamat:
```js
const ctl = new AbortController();
const t = setTimeout(() => ctl.abort(), 8000);
try {
  const r = await fetch('/api', { signal: ctl.signal });
  if (!r.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${r.status}`);
  console.log((await r.json()).length);
} finally { clearTimeout(t); }
```
Setiap fetch: timeout + semak `ok` + tangkap ralat.

