output:
```js
import { readFile } from 'node:fs/promises';
try {
  const [d1, d2] = await Promise.all([
    readFile('a.txt', 'utf8'),
    readFile('b.txt', 'utf8'),
  ]);
  console.log(d1 + d2);
} catch (e) {
  console.error('baca gagal:', e.message);
}
```
`fs/promises` + `Promise.all` selari (bukan bersarang). Satu try/catch tangkap semua — piramid menghilang.

